select-file:
  src: Select an STL file
  tr: 请选择 STL 文件

adding-to-project:
  src: Adding the STL file to the project…
  tr: 正在将 STL 文件添加到工程…

importing:
  src: Importing…
  tr: 正在导入…

large-mesh-warning:
  src: The mesh asset is expected to exceed 2 GiB. Import is allowed, but it may take a long time and require substantial memory and disk space. Make sure your computer and project drive have enough resources before continuing.
  tr: 预计网格资产会超过 2 GiB。仍可继续导入，但可能耗时较长并占用大量内存和磁盘空间；继续前请确认计算机和工程所在磁盘有足够资源。

[ImportDialogHelp]
help-text:
  src: A mesh asset is saved into the project. The original STL can be moved or deleted after import.
  tr: 导入后会将网格资产保存到工程中。原始 STL 文件之后可以移动或删除。

